  "articleBody": "A primary suite addition can create a private bedroom, bathroom, and storage area while improving how the rest of the home functions. The right plan depends on lot dimensions, setbacks, structural conditions, utility routes, bedroom egress, accessibility goals, and whether the work remains part of the main home or becomes a separate dwelling. In San Diego County, start with a feasibility review before requesting construction pricing.",
